@startuml
!include kartoza.iuml
title Tree item workflow status — state machine
[*] --> NotRun
NotRun --> Queued : run all / run item
Queued --> Running : task slot free
Running --> Completed : workflow succeeds
Running --> Failed : error raised
Failed --> Queued : re-run
Completed --> Queued : shift + re-run\n(force recompute)
NotRun --> Excluded : weight = 0 or\n"Do Not Use"
Excluded --> NotRun : re-enabled
Completed --> [*]
@enduml
